er girls, to the point where she often causes mischief by awkwardly butting into their conversations."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c140283"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ツミにはいつも自分だけ見ていてほしいかまってちゃん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"テンションが高く自分が一番可愛いと思っているため、ツミが自分以外の女子と話しているとイライラしがちなところも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんなシーンを見かけると我慢できず割り込んで来る事が多い超絶コミュ症なトラブルメーカー。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26618","sourceWorkId":"36805","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ツミにはいつも自分だけ見ていてほしいかまってちゃん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"テンションが高く自分が一番可愛いと思っているため、ツミが自分以外の女子と話しているとイライラしがちなところも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんなシーンを見かけると我慢できず割り込んで来る事が多い超絶コミュ症なトラブルメーカー。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"161973"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9ab339fcecc08a48553e7ec779f65cbb32e51b025b8d13b7d5c1c64c1d73230c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/41/41e59436cf4108dea6cb8cca80fdb9dd832a9bab3db3b4bdbbce59f56b2ddcc5.webp","width":173,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"石原舞","creatorId":"vndb:s985","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s985","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s985","name":"石原 舞","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:505215:161973:13372:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c140284","characterName":"マツリ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"161976","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"505215"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26619"],"vndbCharacterId":"c140284"},"originalCharacterName":"マツリ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"While she is Tsumi's classmate, Matsuri's mannerisms and demeanor often give off the image of her being older and more mature than she actually is. She often acts flirty and suggestive towards Tsumi, and she particularly enjoys the way he reacts when she gets all close to him. She frequently wears revealing clothes and sometimes even goes around not wearing a bra."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c140284"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ツミと同級生のはずだが雰囲気や仕草が落ち着いていて、どこか大人びて見える少女。「大人びて」が行き過ぎて行動自体がツミに対して際どく色仕掛けになってしまう事もしばしば。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな事態にいちいち反応するツミを見るのも、また楽しみの一つである。露出の多い服装でいる事が多い、ノーブラなことも多い"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26619","sourceWorkId":"36805","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ツミと同級生のはずだが雰囲気や仕草が落ち着いていて、どこか大人びて見える少女。「大人びて」が行き過ぎて行動自体がツミに対して際どく色仕掛けになってしまう事もしばしば。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな事態にいちいち反応するツミを見るのも、また楽しみの一つである。露出の多い服装でいる事が多い、ノーブラなことも多い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"161976"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a3/a3a73ce55f544c09e61989497dcc97b0351e74a0e4495d2526eac2606ce9b18a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/47/47395f53bfd80f88ddf8fa55806047c44dc6136e2b40a69ddfea10ddc3f1eab2.webp","width":160,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"空賀花","creatorId":"vndb:s15476","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15476","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15476","name":"空賀 花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:505215:161976:34089:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c140286","characterName":"ルナ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"161978","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"505215"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26620"],"vndbCharacterId":"c140286"},"originalCharacterName":"ルナ","charact